e Northwest Energy Regulatory Bureau oversees energy market regulation and is involved in the approval and oversight of market participant registrations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"政府引入的第三方征信机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"A third-party credit agency introduced by the government is involved in the verification and monitoring of market participants' credibility and compliance.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"The power trading institution must inform grid enterprises of registration changes within two days, ensuring coordination between market operations and utility services.\"<|>\"information sharing, operational coordination\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"The power trading institution manages the registration and updates for power sales companies, ensuring compliance with market rules and single-agent representation.\"<|>\"regulatory oversight, registration management\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"The power trading institution facilitates the registration and participation of power generation enterprises in direct and generation rights transactions.\"<|>\"market access, transaction facilitation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"The power trading institution handles market registration, contract renewals, and information updates for electricity users, ensuring their eligibility and compliance.\"<|>\"registration management, contract processing\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"Each electricity user can only be represented by one power sales company per trading period, establishing a formal agency relationship.\"<|>\"agency relationship, market representation\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"高耗能用户\"<|>\"Grid enterprises serve as proxy buyers for high-energy-consuming users who cannot exit the market, setting their electricity prices at 1.5 times the proxy purchase price.\"<|>\"proxy procurement, pricing regulation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"自备燃煤机组\"<|