ntity\"<|>\"基准电价+浮动机制\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A market-based pricing mechanism for long-term contracts, where the base price is set according to the benchmark coal-fired power generation price in Ningxia, with adjustable floating ranges based on national policy and market development.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"双边协商\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A method of electricity trading where two parties negotiate terms directly, allowing flexible contract adjustments before the deadline.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"滚动撮合\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A continuous trading mechanism where offers are matched in real-time based on time and price priority, enabling dynamic price discovery.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"集中竞价\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A market mechanism where bids are cleared using rules such as marginal pricing or high-low matching, typically used in scheduled trading sessions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"挂牌交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A trading method where one party posts an offer (listing) and another party accepts it (hitting), forming a transaction through a transparent process.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"年度（多年）交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Annual (multi-year) transaction refers to long-term electricity trading conducted annually, covering next year’s or multiple years’ electricity volumes, primarily via bilateral negotiation with supplementary centralized bidding and listing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Monthly transaction involves short-term electricity trading for the following month, conducted through bilateral negotiations or centralized bidding, including both mid-month and end-of-month sessions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"月内（多日）交易\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Intra-month (multi-day) transaction is a short-cycle trading mechanism for remaining days in a month, primarily conducted through centralized auctions, with regular or continuous opening.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"偏差电量处理\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Deviation Electricity Handling refers to mechanisms for addressing imbalances between planned and actual electricity usage or generation, including pre-registration for adjustments and monthly settlement via deviation pricing.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Security Check is a technical verification process performed by the dispatching authority to validate whether proposed transactions comply with grid safety constraints, ensuring system stability.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"合同电量转让\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"Contract Volume Transfer allows parties to transfer agreed-upon electricity volumes while preserving original contract prices and settlement methods, with new prices negotiated between parties.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"容量补偿机制\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A mechanism designed to ensure long-term power supply security by compensating generators for maintaining available capacity, even if not fully utilized.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"峰谷电价\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A pricing model where electricity prices vary by time of day, with higher rates during peak periods and lower rates during off-peak times, applied to users who continue to follow this structure.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"新投产发电机组调试电量\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Electricity generated during commissioning of newly commissioned power units, settled according to specific debugging tariff policies.\")##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"宁夏发展改革委\"<|>\"年度（多年）交易\"<|>\"The Ningxia Development and Reform Commission sets the framework for annual transactions, including priorities, volumes, and methods, which guides the entire process.\" <|>\"policy setting, market planning\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"月度交易\"<|>\"The Power Trading Institution organizes and manages monthly electricity transactions, including announcing schedules, collecting bids, and publishing results after security checks.\" <|>\"transaction management, market coordination\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"安全校核\"<|>\"The Electric Power Dispatching Institution conducts security checks on transaction outcomes to ensure they do not violate grid operational constraints, thereby safeguarding system integrity.\" <|>\"grid safety, technical validation\"<|>10)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"The Power Trading Institution relies on the Electric Power Dispatching Institution for safety constraint data to conduct valid market clearing, establishing a collaborative workflow.\" <|>\"inter-institutional cooperation, market operation\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"发电企业\"<|>\"滚动撮合\"<|>\"Power generation enterprises participate in rolling match transactions by submitting bid quantities and prices, subject to time and price priority rules.\" <|>\"market participation, competitive trading\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"售电公司\"<|>\"代理购电用户\"<|>\"Power sales companies manage procurement for proxy customers, calculating their electricity prices based on average purchase costs and additional fees.\" <|>\"service provision, price formation\"<|>6)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"基准电价+浮动机制\"<|>\"年度（多年）交易\"<|>\"The 'base price + floating mechanism' is encouraged in annual transactions as a preferred pricing model to support stable, market-driven contracts.\" <|>\"pricing mechanism, contract design\"<|>9)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"偏差电量处理\"<|>\"月内（多日）交易\"<|>\"Intra-month transactions are used as a tool to adjust deviations in monthly plans, helping reduce imbalance risks through timely market interventions.\" <|>\"deviation correction, market flexibility\"<|>8)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"可再生能源电力消纳责任主体\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"Market participants obligated to consume renewable energy must commit to fulfilling their responsibilities and are reminded by the trading institution throughout the transaction process.\" <|>\"regulatory compliance, sustainability obligation\"<|>7)##\n(\"relationship\"<|>\"西北能源监管局\"<|>\"价格上、下限\"<|>\"The Northwest Energy Regulatory Bureau reviews and approves price caps and floors established for centralized bidding to prevent market manipulation and unfair competition.\" <|>\"regulatory oversight, price control\"<|>8)##\n(\"content_keywords\"<|>\"electricity market operations, trading mechanisms, market regulation, renewable energy integration, price formation, grid security, transaction scheduling\")<|COMPLETE|>"
