ly with disclosure and credit obligations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力用户\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"End-users of electricity, including industrial and commercial consumers, who may directly participate in the market or be served through grid companies if unable to join directly; must meet technical and financial criteria.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"储能企业\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Entities involved in energy storage systems that are recognized as valid participants in the power market under the rule, capable of contributing to grid stability and flexibility.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电网企业\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"Electricity transmission and distribution companies responsible for maintaining grid safety, providing fair access and services, collecting fees, and ensuring supply continuity for non-market users.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力交易机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"An institutional body responsible for organizing market transactions, managing platforms and contracts, registering market participants, providing settlement data, monitoring market behavior, and supporting regulatory functions.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力调度机构\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"An entity responsible for real-time grid operation, system balance, security checks, and providing critical operational data to support market execution and coordination with the power trading institution.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力辅助服务市场（补偿）机制\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A separate mechanism related to ancillary services in the power system, currently not covered by this rule but planned for future development.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"双边协商\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A method of conducting power transactions where two parties negotiate directly to reach an agreement on price and volume.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"集中交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A form of power transaction involving organized market mechanisms such as listing, centralized bidding, and rolling matching, conducted through a central platform.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"挂牌\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"A type of centralized tra