ises.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"窗口指导\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Window guidance refers to informal directives issued by market operators to influence behavior without formal rules, and is one of the tools used in market intervention.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"发布临时条款\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Issuing temporary regulations involves introducing short-term rules during emergencies to stabilize market operations.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调整交易\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Adjusting transactions refers to modifying previously cleared trades due to safety concerns or systemic issues, and is a form of market intervention.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"调度纪律\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Dispatching discipline refers to adherence to operational instructions issued by dispatching authorities, and violations are subject to penalties.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"不执行调度命令\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Failure to execute dispatching orders is a violation of operational rules and may lead to penalties or market removal.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"不履行市场合同\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Failure to fulfill market contracts constitutes a breach of agreement and may result in penalties or exclusion from the market.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"违约责任\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"Breach of contract responsibilities refers to the obligations imposed on market participants who fail to meet their contractual commitments.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"电力市场技术支持系统\"<|>\"organization\"<|>\"The power market technical support system is a platform used by market participants to submit information and is required to ensure data authenticity, accuracy, and timeliness.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"国家信息安全三级等级防护要求\"<|>\"category\"<|>\"National Information Security Level 3 Protection Requirements are mandatory standards that the electricity trading platform and website must meet to ensure cybersecurity.\")##\n(\"entity\"<|>\"解释申请\"<|>\"event\"<|>\"An explanation request is a formal process initiated by a market participant when they have objections to disclosed information, which must be addressed by the trading